                "loc": "PSA.142"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "142",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Daudi wauka kula Gathi achichimbirira panga ya Adulamu. Nduguze na atu osi a mbari ya ise ariphosikira kukala Daudi a hiko, akpwendadziunga naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu ariokala na shida, enye madeni na enye utsungu mwao mioyoni amlunga Daudi naye achikala chilongozi wao. Na hinyo ariokala phamwenga naye kala ni atu kama magana mane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula hiko Daudi waphiya Mizipa kpwenye tsi ya Moabu achendamuambira mfalume wa Moabu, “Nikubaliya baba na mayo akutuluke hiko ariko, edze asagale kpwako hadi ndiphomanya rira ndiro henderwa ni Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi achiareha kpwa mfalume wa Moabu nao asagala phamwenga naye wakati wosi Daudi ariphokala achadzifwitsa pangoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nabii Gadi achimuambira Daudi, “Usikale hipha, uka uphiye hadi tsi ya Juda.” Ndipho Daudi achiuka, achendasagala kpwenye tsaka ra Herethi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taziyatsupa siku nyinji Sauli wasikira kukala Daudi na hara atu ariokala phamwenga naye akaonekana. Sauli kala asegere tsini ya mkpwadzu, dzulu ya chidzango ko Gibeya. Kala akagbwiririra fumo mwakpwe mkpwononi na maofisaage osi kala akamzunguluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Sauli waambira higo maofisaage garigomzunguluka, “Phundzani sambi, mwimwi atu a mbari ya Benjamini. Dze! Munafikiri ye mwana wa Jese achikala mfalume andakuphani chila mmwenga minda na minda ya mizabibu? Dze! Andakuhendani mkale akulu a vikosi vya anajeshi elufu-elufu na akulu a vikosi vya anajeshi gana-gana? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go ndigo gokuhendani muzule njama dzulu yangu? Mana taphana hata mutu mmwenga aniambiraye mwanangu ahendapho chilagane na mwana wa Jese, wala taphana mmwenga wenu anayenisononekera, wala kunimanyisa kukala mwanangu anafyakatsira mtumishi wangu anigalukire na aniviziye dza irivyo vivi rero?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
