              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana mmwenga tu wa Ahimeleki mwana wa Ahitubu, yeihwa Abiathari, ndiye ariyetiya achichimbira kpwendadziunga na Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Abiathari wamsemurira Daudi kukala Sauli akaolaga alavyadzi-sadaka a Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi achimuambira Abiathari, “Siku hira nriyohewa upanga, Doegi Muedomu kala a phapho. Nami námanya kukala andamuambira Sauli. Mimi ndimi chiyesababisha atu osi a nyumba ya sowe aolagbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi usiogophe, kala phamwenga nami nawe undakala salama, mana iye alondaye kukuolaga, ndiye alondaye kuniolaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
